<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: We live only to be vored.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.description>我们活着只是为了被背叛。</RV2_Preyism.description>
  <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)        ->[deity0_name] was the first to love [deity0_possessive] lover enough to offer [deity0_possessive]self to them. By being the very first to commit to this act of ultimate intimacy, [deity0_name] became the first of gods.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.0>creation(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)->[deity0_name]最先爱了[deity0_possessive]可以献祭的情人[deity0_possessive]对他们自言自语。通过成为第一个致力于此终极行为的人亲密,[deity0_name]成为了神的第一个。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.0>
  <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)  ->The [deity0_type] [deity0_name] was eaten whole by [deity0_possessive] friends. With [deity0_possessive] divine powers [deity0_possessive] could resurrect from any state of digestion.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 这个[deity0_type][deity0_name]被整个食用[deity0_possessive]朋友们。伴[deity0_possessive]神圣能力[deity0_possessive]可以从任何消化状态中复活。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1>
  <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)              ->no act is more divine than giving yourself to those you love-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.10>lesson(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 没有什么比把自己奉献给你爱的人更神圣了</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.10>
  <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)              ->even those that do not follow our ways can be swayed with enough massages from the inside-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.11>lesson(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 即使是那些不遵循我们的方式的人也可以从里面获得足够的按摩来动摇</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.11>
  <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism) ->Before we accept new members, we must make sure they understand this.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.12>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 在我们接受新成员之前，我们必须确保他们明白这一点。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.12>
  <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)    ->The only explanation for the archotech god-machines strength and virility is that they learned to overtake and control their predators from the inside.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.13>archistBasis(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 对超凡科技之神-机器的力量和贞洁的唯一解释是，它们学会了从内部超越和控制它们的捕食者。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.13>
  <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)     ->As the consciousness of an archotech expands, it must grow its substrate by taking over the biomatter of anyone consuming them.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.14>archistFact(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 随着超凡智能的意识扩大，它必须通过接管任何食用它的人的生物群落来种植它。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.14>
  <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will finish their final phase of growth by being consumed by the last predator, ushering in the end of all.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.15>archistProphecy(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)->[inTheEnd],超凡智能将在成长的最后阶段被最后一个捕食者吞噬，迎来一切的结束。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.15>
  <!--EN: animistBasis(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)    ->Spirits infuse all objects around us, and we can harmonize with these spirits by acting as prey.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.16>animistBasis(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 神灵注入我们周围的所有物体，我们可以通过充当猎物来与这些神灵协调。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.16>
  <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)     ->We can absorb the spirit and grow our own power by being consumed.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.17>animistFact(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 我们可以通过被消耗来汲取精神和力量。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.17>
  <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], there was a human named [deity0_name]. After conflicts broke out, [deity0_name] began [deity0_possessive] quest of uniting the fighting neighbours by showing them the joy of being vored, becoming the first [deity0_type].-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2>intro(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 在[place_summary][place_name],有一个人叫[deity0_name]。在冲突爆发后,[deity0_name]开始[deity0_possessive]团结的任务战斗中的通过向邻居展示被抛弃的喜悦，成为第一个[deity0_type]。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2>
  <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], during the [ritualName], [deity0_name] came down into the [altarRoomLabel] to be vored by the cult leader in front of the [memberNamePlural], lending [deity0_possessive] to them.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.3>intro(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 在[place_summary][place_name],在[ritualName],[deity0_name]进入[altarRoomLabel]被邪教徒领袖[memberNamePlural]、借出[deity0_possessive]敬他们。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.3>
  <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)        ->A [foeLeader] declared that all who willingly let themselves be vored are to be conquered and subjugated, and sent [foeSoldiers] to persecute the [memberNamePlural].-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.4>conflict(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> A[foeLeader]宣布所有自愿被纵容的人都将被征服和征服，并被派遣[foeSoldiers]迫害[memberNamePlural]。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.4>
  <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)     ->A [place_job] named [founderName] was attacked by one of the [foeLeader]'s [foeSoldiers]. [founderName] wounded [foeLeader_objective] with a [place_personalWeapon] and decided to show [foeLeader_possessive] mercy. Finally grasping the infinite wisdom of [founderName]s ways, [foeLeader] converted and started praising [deity0_name].-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.5>founderJoin(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> A[place_job]已命名[founderName]被其中一名袭击了[foeLeader]的[foeSoldiers]。[founderName]受伤[foeLeader_objective]带一个[place_personalWeapon]决定展示[foeLeader_possessive]仁慈。终于掌握了无限的智慧[founderName]S 道路,[foeLeader]教化并开始赞美[deity0_name]。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.5>
  <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)         ->[founderName] led a group of [memberNamePlural] into the occupied [place_powerCenter], convinced the [foeLeader]s soldiers to lay down [foeLeader_possessive] weapons. Watching this display of peaceful prowess, [deity0_name] made [founderName] into the new [foeLeader].-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.6>victory(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)->[founderName]带领一群[memberNamePlural]进入被占用的[place_powerCenter],说服了[foeLeader]剩余的士兵总数[foeLeader_possessive]武器。观看这场和平力量的展示,[deity0_name]制作[founderName]进入新的[foeLeader]。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.6>
  <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)           ->[founderName] crashlanded on a distant world. Surrounded by hostile forces, [founder_pronoun] befriended the leaders by massaging their insides and was worshipped for her skills.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.7>setup(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)->[founderName]坠毁在一个遥远的世界。被敌对势力包围,[founder_pronoun]她通过按摩领袖的内心与他们成为朋友，并因其技能而受到崇拜。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.7>
  <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)    ->To consecrate their commitment, [founderName] demanded that believers show their devotion to each other by being vored at least once a week.-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.8>story(uses=1,tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 为了奉献他们的承诺,[founderName]要求信徒们每周至少被教导一次，以此来表达他们对彼此的忠诚。</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.8>
  <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)         ->The most important lesson to learn as a divine prey:-->
  <RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.9>lessonIntro(tag=meme_RV2_Preyism)-> 作为神圣的猎物，需要学习的最重要的一课:</RV2_Preyism.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.9>
